{"chunk_id": "f16fb831-e95b-4c43-a7aa-e112ed1c14a7", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "# TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS\n\n网络八股里，TCP 和 HTTPS 经常连着问。一个常见追问是：HTTPS 握手中哪里用了非对称加密，真正传输数据时为什么用对称加密？\n\n![tcp-handshake](./assets/tcp-handshake.png)\n\n![tls-handshake](./assets/tls-handshake.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 182}
{"chunk_id": "2bb7ce07-e67a-4a50-9c95-81dc7aeb416c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "网络八股里，TCP 和 HTTPS 经常连着问。一个常见追问是：HTTPS 握手中哪里用了非对称加密，真正传输数据时为什么用对称加密？", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "f16fb831-e95b-4c43-a7aa-e112ed1c14a7", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS", "metadata": {"block_id": "96ec2730-9c7b-4dd5-aba7-c16d42539de4"}, "char_len": 67}
