{"chunk_id": "0e1852be-f403-4ac8-a0d3-47388d17e67e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "![tls-handshake](./assets/tls-handshake.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "f16fb831-e95b-4c43-a7aa-e112ed1c14a7", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "image_ocr", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS", "metadata": {"block_id": "b3ff3e2a-d792-44b7-9375-5644c7e1d03a"}, "char_len": 44}
{"chunk_id": "45b9ddff-b475-48c2-866b-d647fd730263", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 一、TCP 如何保证可靠传输\n\nTCP 通过序列号、确认应答、超时重传、滑动窗口、拥塞控制、流量控制等机制保证可靠传输。\n\n序列号用于标记字节流位置，ACK 表示接收方已经收到哪些数据。超时重传用于处理丢包，滑动窗口提升吞吐，流量控制避免把接收方打爆，拥塞控制避免把网络打爆。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 一、TCP 如何保证可靠传输", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 141}
{"chunk_id": "bf90fb3e-e92d-49e0-ac20-c42dbd9f4b7e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "TCP 通过序列号、确认应答、超时重传、滑动窗口、拥塞控制、流量控制等机制保证可靠传输。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "45b9ddff-b475-48c2-866b-d647fd730263", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 一、TCP 如何保证可靠传输", "metadata": {"block_id": "8f656d60-9362-4c31-aa3b-34b4312d22ab"}, "char_len": 44}
{"chunk_id": "35ae10e1-4b72-4f0e-910f-9ed2e9d2f91e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "序列号用于标记字节流位置，ACK 表示接收方已经收到哪些数据。超时重传用于处理丢包，滑动窗口提升吞吐，流量控制避免把接收方打爆，拥塞控制避免把网络打爆。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "45b9ddff-b475-48c2-866b-d647fd730263", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 一、TCP 如何保证可靠传输", "metadata": {"block_id": "a15d0252-a9ff-4093-8b19-dd35a1aecf55"}, "char_len": 76}
{"chunk_id": "de9b411e-f910-4900-9353-a4820050e62c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 二、三次握手\n\n三次握手的目标是建立连接，并让双方确认彼此收发能力正常。\n\n1. 客户端发送 SYN；\n2. 服务端返回 SYN + ACK；\n3. 客户端返回 ACK。\n\n为什么不是两次？因为服务端也需要确认客户端能收到自己的响应。三次握手可以减少历史连接请求造成的问题。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 二、三次握手", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 140}
{"chunk_id": "48ace2a3-e839-45a5-a20d-b36f94f27b0f", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "三次握手的目标是建立连接，并让双方确认彼此收发能力正常。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "de9b411e-f910-4900-9353-a4820050e62c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 二、三次握手", "metadata": {"block_id": "83d6d85f-ed6e-470f-a17f-d96c94fe40ba"}, "char_len": 28}
{"chunk_id": "f0fabb5b-1b85-4bc0-ad14-971667adbb3c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "1. 客户端发送 SYN；\n2. 服务端返回 SYN + ACK；\n3. 客户端返回 ACK。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "de9b411e-f910-4900-9353-a4820050e62c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 二、三次握手", "metadata": {"block_id": "5919919f-1d92-424d-94f7-e2366656a5c9"}, "char_len": 47}
{"chunk_id": "95fbd72d-890f-4956-91d7-94470a4b71ea", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "为什么不是两次？因为服务端也需要确认客户端能收到自己的响应。三次握手可以减少历史连接请求造成的问题。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "de9b411e-f910-4900-9353-a4820050e62c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 二、三次握手", "metadata": {"block_id": "ffaed9d3-42a0-47cb-9db1-5687d2185f52"}, "char_len": 50}
{"chunk_id": "dba01d48-c283-4398-889d-b9e478c60036", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 三、四次挥手和 TIME_WAIT\n\n连接关闭通常需要四次挥手，因为 TCP 是全双工的，双方的发送方向需要分别关闭。\n\nTIME_WAIT 出现在主动关闭方，主要作用是：\n- 确保最后一个 ACK 能被对方收到；\n- 等待旧连接中的延迟报文自然消失，避免影响新连接。\n\nCLOSE_WAIT 大量出现通常更像应用层没有及时关闭连接。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 三、四次挥手和 TIME_WAIT", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 170}
{"chunk_id": "f18a718e-5ec6-4f74-a866-8e42b48ad986", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "连接关闭通常需要四次挥手，因为 TCP 是全双工的，双方的发送方向需要分别关闭。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "dba01d48-c283-4398-889d-b9e478c60036", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 三、四次挥手和 TIME_WAIT", "metadata": {"block_id": "dd73ce93-42f5-4c38-b868-576d050b7ea7"}, "char_len": 40}
{"chunk_id": "8a0ac3dd-133b-4aab-ae9f-04aff487dd8f", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "TIME_WAIT 出现在主动关闭方，主要作用是：\n- 确保最后一个 ACK 能被对方收到；\n- 等待旧连接中的延迟报文自然消失，避免影响新连接。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "dba01d48-c283-4398-889d-b9e478c60036", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 三、四次挥手和 TIME_WAIT", "metadata": {"block_id": "1e9035cb-571e-4190-892a-896045dde393"}, "char_len": 73}
{"chunk_id": "09f0938f-6c02-4646-acf8-a8da683686ec", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "CLOSE_WAIT 大量出现通常更像应用层没有及时关闭连接。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "dba01d48-c283-4398-889d-b9e478c60036", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 三、四次挥手和 TIME_WAIT", "metadata": {"block_id": "5a55b4f2-13cf-4ec7-9363-b944eb61d2ea"}, "char_len": 31}
{"chunk_id": "bad30513-dfbd-43bb-bb69-2e2821ca03bd", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 四、HTTPS 和 TLS\n\nHTTPS = HTTP + TLS。TLS 握手阶段使用非对称加密、证书、密钥交换等机制来协商会话密钥。真正传输业务数据时，通常使用对称加密，因为对称加密性能更好，适合大量数据传输。\n\n面试回答时可以说：非对称加密解决身份认证和密钥协商，对称加密解决高效数据传输。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 四、HTTPS 和 TLS", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 151}
{"chunk_id": "b8e1fff9-6e3e-4e9b-88f7-49c7e60dbf44", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "HTTPS = HTTP + TLS。TLS 握手阶段使用非对称加密、证书、密钥交换等机制来协商会话密钥。真正传输业务数据时，通常使用对称加密，因为对称加密性能更好，适合大量数据传输。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "bad30513-dfbd-43bb-bb69-2e2821ca03bd", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 四、HTTPS 和 TLS", "metadata": {"block_id": "1d81e48c-afd7-41ec-a249-aa4894e75c5c"}, "char_len": 92}
{"chunk_id": "54437064-b24e-4d8e-9633-7f9d6a466aa2", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "面试回答时可以说：非对称加密解决身份认证和密钥协商，对称加密解决高效数据传输。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "bad30513-dfbd-43bb-bb69-2e2821ca03bd", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 四、HTTPS 和 TLS", "metadata": {"block_id": "f1c9b3a4-5c82-417b-9dac-4d2dcd74dc6e"}, "char_len": 39}
{"chunk_id": "c83806dc-e5fa-4f2f-a67b-9a3a4fdd0962", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 五、HTTP/2 队头阻塞\n\nHTTP/2 在应用层通过 stream 和 frame 实现多路复用，解决了 HTTP/1.1 请求层面的队头阻塞。但因为底层仍然依赖 TCP，如果 TCP 某个包丢了，后续字节流都要等待重传，所以队头阻塞下沉到了 TCP 层。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 五、HTTP/2 队头阻塞", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 133}
{"chunk_id": "1a1f6436-0d97-442d-8210-35c1251842a9", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "HTTP/2 在应用层通过 stream 和 frame 实现多路复用，解决了 HTTP/1.1 请求层面的队头阻塞。但因为底层仍然依赖 TCP，如果 TCP 某个包丢了，后续字节流都要等待重传，所以队头阻塞下沉到了 TCP 层。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "c83806dc-e5fa-4f2f-a67b-9a3a4fdd0962", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 五、HTTP/2 队头阻塞", "metadata": {"block_id": "b907bf97-ffe9-4989-8e05-e6a2ffd2ad6f"}, "char_len": 115}
{"chunk_id": "3b8a7578-6701-4575-80d0-3aa4f028effa", "doc_id": "xiaolin_003_tcp_https", "text": "## 广告块\n\n回复「网络」领取图解 TCP 和 HTTPS。  \n推荐阅读：图解 HTTP/2、图解 QUIC、图解 DNS。  \n本文首发公众号，转载请联系作者。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "TCP 可靠传输和 HTTPS/TLS > 广告块", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 83}
